GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

OsmAnd is an offline world map application based on OpenStreetMap (OSM), which allows you to navigate taking into account the preferred roads and vehicle dimensions. Plan routes based on inclines and record GPX tracks without an internet connection.
OsmAnd is an open source app. We do not collect user data and you decide what data the app will have access to.

Main features:

Map view
• Choice of places to be displayed on the map: attractions, food, health and more;
• Search for places by address, name, coordinates, or category;
• Map styles for the convenience of different activities: touring view, nautical map, winter and ski, topographic, desert, off-road, and others;
• Shading relief and plug-in contour lines;
• Ability to overlay different sources of maps on top of each other;

GPS Navigation
• Plotting a route to a place without an Internet connection;
• Customizable navigation profiles for different vehicles: cars, motorcycles, bicycles, 4x4, pedestrians, boats, public transport, and more;
• Change the constructed route, taking into account the exclusion of certain roads or road surfaces;
• Customizable information widgets about the route: distance, speed, remaining travel time, distance to turn, and more;

Route Planning and Recording
• Plotting a route point by point using one or multiple navigation profiles;
• Route recording using GPX tracks;
• Manage GPX tracks: displaying your own or imported GPX tracks on the map, navigating through them;
• Visual data about the route - descents/ascents, distances;
• Ability to share GPX track in OpenStreetMap;

Creation of points with different functionality
• Favourites;
• Markers;

OpenStreetMap
• Making edits to OSM;
• Updating maps with a frequency of up to one hour;

Additional features
• Compass and radius ruler;
• Mapillary interface;
• Night theme;
• Large community of users around the world, documentation, and support;


Paid features:


OsmAnd Maps+ (in-app or subscription):
• Unlimited map downloads;
• Topo data (Contour lines and Terrain);
• Nautical depths;
• Offline Wikipedia;
• Apple CarPlay support;

OsmAnd Pro (subscription):
• All Maps+ features;
• Weather forecast on the map online/offline;
• OsmAnd Cloud (backup and restore);
• Customize Route line;
• Hourly map updates.

The new TaxiClub application will help you book a taxi all over Moldova. A user-friendly application interface will help you easily place an order. It is designed for users of all ages to help them get the right information in any kind of situations. Get rid of the waste of time for explanations, where to meet you and where the destination point is. Just use one of the currently available options:
- address selection from the built-in catalog;
- search for the address on the Google Maps or/and Yandex Maps;
- book a car by pointing on the map.
Get permanent updates regarding  your order on the smartphone screen:
- distance from the start address to the destination point;
- the preliminary cost of the order;
- current status of the order;
- data on the assigned car;
- final check of the trip.
If necessary, use the option to communicate with the driver directly from the application.
Your choice is important for us, so we strive to improve your comfort when using our taxi services. Try the mobile application to call a taxi and make sure each of our interactions will become even more convenient and pleasant.

Uklon: More than a taxi


Uklon is a Ukrainian service for online car ordering.


Download the Uklon app to do such things:
- Order a driver for a personal car;
- Send packages up to 20 kg without additional charge through the "Delivery" service;
- Go to another city of Ukraine;
- Quickly and conveniently order a car around the city;
- Manage the price of your trip;
- Pay by cash and non-cash payment method;
- Order a car for a trip with a pet;
- Choose additional services: non-smoking driver, English-speaking driver, meeting with a sign, etc.;
- Pre-order a car for a certain time;
- Have a fixed cost of trips.


But the most important thing is that our technical support works 24/7 to help you at any moment.


The service already works in 28 cities of Ukraine: Kyiv, Kharkiv, Zaporizhzhia, Vinnytsia, Ivano-Frankivsk, Poltava, Odesa, Dnipro, Lviv, Mykolaiv, Mariupol, Kherson, Kryvyi Rih, Bila Tserkva, Chernivtsi, Khmelnytskyi, Lutsk, Rivne, Ternopil, Uzhhorod, Kremenchuk, Kamianske, Kropyvnytskyi, Cherkasy, Chernihiv, Sumy, Zhytomyr, Kamianets-Podilskyi.
*** Unfortunately, the service is temporarily unavailable in Mariupol. Mariupol is Ukrainian citiy!


Move your world with Uklon!


If you have any suggestions, requests or find any mistakes, please contact us: ios@uklon.com.ua

The Save&Drive OMV  application is designed for all new and existing members of the Save&Drive  program who would like to keep up-to-date with all latest program features and to have their virtual card in the phone.
The application offers:
- Save&Drive VIRTUAL CARD for easy identification, replacing the plastic Save&Drive card for existing users;
- REGISTRATION VIA YOUR MOBILE PHONE for those who are not yet members of the Save&Drive program;
- INFORMATION ON THE CURRENT Save&Drive SPECIAL OFFERS available on filling stations;
- CONTACT FORM to the Contact Centre for any additional information;
- Fast and easy update and changes of user information in Save&Drive profile. 
As we seek to improve our application further through additional content, offers and services, we would like to thank you in advance for your constructive comments and suggestions.
More information about the Save&Drive  program of OMV in Bulgaria and the mobile application can be found on www.omv.bg/save-and-drive.
